## `OVHcloud`

### Summary

| Fit | Resources |
|---|---|
| direct | 6 |
| partial | 2 |
| none | 3 |
| total | 11 |

### Resources

| ID | Raw type | Category | Fit | Best offering | Plan | Monthly estimate | Reasons |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `bucket-example` | `AWS::S3::Bucket` | `storage.object` | direct | `Object Storage` (tie: `Object Storage 3-AZ`) |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Object Storage` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `cluster-example` | `AWS::EKS::Cluster` | `kubernetes.managed` | direct | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Managed Kubernetes Service 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-autoscaling-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBCluster` | `database.postgresql` | partial | `Managed PostgreSQL` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Managed PostgreSQL` does not offer `autoscaling` |
| `db-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-node-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced`, `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `db-zone-example` | `AWS::RDS::DBInstance` | `database.postgresql` | direct | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ` (tie: `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node Advanced 3-AZ`) |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Managed PostgreSQL Multi-node 3-AZ` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `fn-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  |  | not estimated: no fit | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `fn-ipv6-example` | `AWS::Lambda::Function` | `serverless.function` | none |  |  | not estimated: no fit | no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function` |
| `i-0123456789abcdef0` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Instances` offers every capability the resource uses |
| `misc-example` | `AWS::CloudFormation::CustomResource` | `unclassified` | none |  |  | not estimated: no fit | not classified |
| `partial-example` | `AWS::EC2::Instance` | `compute.vm` | partial | `Instances` |  | not estimated: size unknown | `Instances` does not offer `node-high-availability` |

### Required changes

- `db-autoscaling-example`: `autoscaling` (not offered by `Managed PostgreSQL`)
- `partial-example`: `node-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

### Blockers

- `fn-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `fn-ipv6-example`: no offering in the `OVHcloud` catalog for `serverless.function`
- `misc-example`: not classified

### Cost estimate

- Total: €0.00 per month for 0 of 11 resources
- Estimate: list prices on 2026-11-13, excluding VAT and discounts; a fixed fee is the offering's listed fee
- Prices in `GRA`
- Hours: plan price × count × hours / 730, 730 hours for a resource that gives none
- Source cost: none in the inventory

